%S A401293 0,0,0,0,0,2,10,36,104,270,646,1472,3228,6906,14490,30012,61536,
%T A401293 125318,253870,512472,1031684,2073138,4160098,8340116,16708296,
%U A401293 33456894,66970422,134022000,268157868,536478698,1073185834,2146698348,4293854384,8588362998
%N A401293 Number of orange squares after n unfoldings in the edge-memory unfolding array.
%C A401293 Start with one green square. At each step, double the array by reflecting it alternately downward and rightward. Each existing square produces a mirrored offspring. A newborn square is orange if its parent has never been on the outer edge of the array; otherwise, it is green. Colors never change. See A401290 for further details.
%C A401293 The first orange squares appear at the fifth unfolding.
%C A401293 The color of an offspring depends on its parent's edge history, not its parent's color. No orange square ever reaches an edge.
%C A401293 The orange squares first outnumber the green squares at the ninth unfolding, when there are 270 orange squares and 242 green squares.
%C A401293 The complementary green-square sequence is 2^n - a(n).
%H A401293 Ali Sada, <a href="/A401293/a401293.jpg">Illustration of the first ten unfoldings</a>
%F A401293 a(n+1) = A027556(n-1) + 2*a(n) - a(n-1) for n > 0, a(n) = 0 for n < 5. - _M. F. Hasler_, Oct 19 2026
%e A401293 After four unfoldings, all 16 squares are green, so a(4) = 0.
%e A401293 At the fifth unfolding, two newborn squares have parents that have never been on an edge. Therefore, a(5) = 2.
%e A401293 At the sixth unfolding, eight additional orange squares appear, giving a(6) = 10.
%o A401293 (Python)
%o A401293 def A401293(n):
%o A401293     if not hasattr(A:=A401293, 'a'): A.a= [0]*5
%o A401293     while (L:=len(A.a)) <= n:
%o A401293         A.a.append((2**(L-3>>1)-1)*(2**(L-2>>1)-1)*2+2*A.a[-1]-A.a[-2])
%o A401293     return A.a[n] # _M. F. Hasler_, Oct 19 2026
%Y A401293 Cf. A401290 (number of green squares).
%Y A401293 Cf. A027556 (number of unbalanced strings).
%K A401293 nonn,new
%O A401293 0,6
%A A401293 _Ali Sada_, Oct 19 2026
